  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "36903001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "……嘛，这里是「爱猫社区」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "环境总体上还过得去，比前面介绍的那些商业街要安静多了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "便利店啊杂货铺什么的都有，但没什么像样的大商场，毕竟是居民区嘛。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "宠物店有好几家，引来了不少野猫，这一点要大大扣分。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "顺带一提，那位大名鼎鼎的手办收藏家就住在这。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "呵呵呵，好多手办有事没事往这跑，|101|家里的门槛都快被踏破了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "……你没兴趣？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "好吧，那我们换一个景点，这个有点冷门……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "它叫做「绿洲」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "虽然很多人都不知道，但它其实是管理局旗下的收容设施，只有最最最倒霉的那一批「坏手办」才有资格入住。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "高耸的围墙、重重的哨卡、全天候的安保，还有敬业又冷酷的守卫们……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "想要闯进里面，大概需要调集一支军队才行吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "即使是我，也没自信能够把手办从里面捞出来。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "最精彩的部分来了，这样可怕的堡垒为什么会叫做「绿洲」呢？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "据说它在过去是许多手办梦寐以求的「应许之地」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "曾经有一批手办聚集在那里，对抗管理局所建立的秩序。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "他们以此为据点，壮大自己的势力，然后和管理局大决战！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "但是很遗憾……呜呜……他们失败了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "最后，管理局的高层觉得要物尽其用，就把据点改造成收容设施啦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "……「天使」小姐，你有在听吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "嗯，我在听。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "……我理解你说的情况了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "36903023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "那么，如果是「你们」的话……能够突破那里吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
